      <div class="insight-card">
        <strong>The Lag Pattern:</strong> Research leads industry by 2-4 years, while regulation lags industry by 3-5 years. (e.g., Transformer in 2017 → ChatGPT in 2022 = 5.4 yr lag. ChatGPT to EU AI Act = 1.3 yr lag).
      </div>
      <div class="insight-card">
        <strong>The ChatGPT Inflection:</strong> Nov 2022 compressed the multi-year lag into months. Within just 14 months, the Biden EO, EU AI Act agreement, and Bletchley Declaration all happened.
